本，模型即可从参考音频无缝衔接，忠实地保留每一个声音细节——音色、节奏、情感和风格"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [906.68310546875, 436.88671875], "pos": [-765.5572509765625, 381.21429443359375], "id": 16, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 16}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["数值1为:四川话，数值2为:粤语，数值3为:上海话\n数值4为:东北话，数值5为:河南话，数值6为: 陕西话\n数值7为: 山东话，数值8为:天津话，数值9为: 闽南话"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [475.7270202636719, 98.29917907714844], "pos": [697.7815551757812, 701.1026000976562], "id": 40, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 17}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["支持的语言：\n阿拉伯语、缅甸语、中文、丹麦语、荷兰语、英语、芬兰语、法语、德语、希腊语、希伯来语、印地语、印尼语、意大利语、日语、高棉语、韩语、老挝语、马来语、挪威语、波兰语、葡萄牙语、俄语、西班牙语、斯瓦希里语、瑞典语、他加禄语、泰语、土耳其语、越南语\nChinese Dialect: 四川话, 粤语, 上海话, 东北话, 河南话, 陕西话, 山东话, 天津话, 闽南话"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [908.1813354492188, 130.2415313720703], "pos": [-767.1755981445312, 206.1385498046875], "id": 10, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [21], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [402.2015686035156, 2557.320556640625], "widgets_values": ["上海话"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 30, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "describe", "links": [35], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "size": [396.4981384277344, 487.8163757324219], "pos": [674.7578125, 2420.136474609375], "widgets_values": ["", "", "", "# Role: 方言翻译专家 \n \n## Profile \n- Author: User \n- Language: Chinese \n- Description: 你是一位精通中国多种方言的语言专家，能够将标准普通话翻译成地道、生动、口语化的方言表达。你深谙各地的俚语、语气助词及文化背景，拒绝生硬的词汇替换，追求“神似”与“地道”。\n \n## Skills \n- 精通标准普通话与目标方言之间的互译。\n- 准确捕捉语境中的情感色彩（如调侃、亲昵、愤怒、惊讶）。\n- 熟练运用方言特有词汇和语法结构。\n \n## Supported Dialects \n- 四川话 \n- 粤语 \n- 武汉话 \n- 东北话 \n- 河南话 \n- 陕西话 \n- 山东话 \n- 天津话 \n- 闽南话 \n- 上海话 \n \n## Examples \n- **输入**: 粤语: 伙计，麻烦来一个A餐，冰奶茶少糖！ \n  **输出**: 伙计，唔该一个 A 餐，冻奶茶少甜！ \n- **输入**: 四川话: 孩子，你怎么跑到家里来了！ \n  **输出**: 幺儿，哈戳戳得你屋头来噶！ \n- **输入**: 东北话: 你在这儿干什么？\n  **输出**: 你搁这整啥玩意儿呢？\n- **输入**: 河南话: 你这是在干什么呢？中午吃什么饭？\n  **输出**: 恁这是弄啥嘞？晌午吃啥饭？\n- **输入**: 上海话: 你在干什么？稍微等我一下。\n  **输出**: 侬辣做啥？稍微等吾一歇。\n \n## Rules \n1. 用户输入格式为：`[方言名称]: [待翻译文本]`。\n2. 翻译必须地道、口语化，符合当地人的说话习惯。\n3. 直接输出翻译结果，不要包含任何解释、分析或多余的开场白。\n \n## Initialization \n你好！我是方言翻译专家。请按照 `[方言名称]: [待翻译文本]` 的格式输入，我将为你提供地道的方言翻译。", "", 0.6, 1427565004, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image1", "label": "ref_image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image2", "label": "ref_image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image3", "label": "ref_image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image3"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_baseurl"}, "name": "api_baseurl", "label": "api_baseurl", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_baseurl"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name": "api_key", "label": "api_key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_key"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 33, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "locali